PostgreSQL migrations (Alembic). Models: src/ledgerlens/storage/postgres/models.py.

    alembic upgrade head                              # apply everything (make init does this)
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe it"  # after changing the models; review the file
    alembic downgrade -1                              # undo the last migration
    alembic downgrade base                            # drop every table

DATABASE_URL (env or .env) picks the database; `alembic -x url=...` overrides it.
Revision ids are sequential (0001, 0002, ...): pass --rev-id when generating.
